{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "DPDP Compliance Auditor",
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "semanticVersion": "0.1.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "DPDP-NOT-001",
              "name": "PersonalDataCollectedWithoutANoticeOfDataAndPurpose",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data collected without a notice of data and purpose"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Notice must give an itemised description of the personal data and the specified purpose."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Show an itemised notice (data fields + purpose) before or with the consent request.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.5(1), DPDP Rules Rule 3(b). Notice must give an itemised description of the personal data and the specified purpose.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Show an itemised notice (data fields + purpose) before or with the consent request.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.5(1), DPDP Rules Rule 3(b). Notice must give an itemised description of the personal data and the specified purpose."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "notice",
                  "s.5(1)",
                  "Rule 3(b)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "severity": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-CON-001",
              "name": "ConsentCanBeGivenButNotWithdrawn",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Consent can be given but not withdrawn"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Withdrawal must be possible at any time, with ease comparable to giving consent; processing must then stop."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Add DELETE /consent (or POST /consent/withdraw) that clears consent and stops downstream processing.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.6(4), DPDP Act s.6(6), DPDP Rules Rule 3(c)(i). Withdrawal must be possible at any time, with ease comparable to giving consent; processing must then stop.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Add DELETE /consent (or POST /consent/withdraw) that clears consent and stops downstream processing.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.6(4), DPDP Act s.6(6), DPDP Rules Rule 3(c)(i). Withdrawal must be possible at any time, with ease comparable to giving consent; processing must then stop."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "consent",
                  "s.6(4)",
                  "s.6(6)",
                  "Rule 3(c)(i)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-CON-002",
              "name": "PreTickedOrDefaultTrueConsent",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Pre-ticked or default-true consent"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Consent must be unambiguous with a clear affirmative action."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Default consent to false and require an explicit user action.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.6(1). Consent must be unambiguous with a clear affirmative action.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Default consent to false and require an explicit user action.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.6(1). Consent must be unambiguous with a clear affirmative action."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "consent",
                  "s.6(1)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-CON-003",
              "name": "NoEvidenceOfConsentStored",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "No evidence of consent stored"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The Data Fiduciary must be able to prove notice was given and consent obtained."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Store consent records with user id, purpose, notice version, timestamp and channel.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.6(10). The Data Fiduciary must be able to prove notice was given and consent obtained.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Store consent records with user id, purpose, notice version, timestamp and channel.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.6(10). The Data Fiduciary must be able to prove notice was given and consent obtained."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "consent",
                  "s.6(10)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "severity": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-CON-004",
              "name": "PersonalDataUsedWithoutCheckingConsent",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data used without checking consent"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Process only on consent or a legitimate use, limited to the specified purpose."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Add a consent guard (middleware or decorator) before purpose-specific processing.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.4(1), DPDP Act s.6(1). Process only on consent or a legitimate use, limited to the specified purpose.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Add a consent guard (middleware or decorator) before purpose-specific processing.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.4(1), DPDP Act s.6(1). Process only on consent or a legitimate use, limited to the specified purpose."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "consent",
                  "s.4(1)",
                  "s.6(1)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-CON-005",
              "name": "OverCollectionBeyondTheStatedPurpose",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Over-collection beyond the stated purpose"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Consent is limited to personal data necessary for the specified purpose."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Remove unused fields and permissions, or tie each one to a stated purpose.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.6(1). Consent is limited to personal data necessary for the specified purpose.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Remove unused fields and permissions, or tie each one to a stated purpose.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.6(1). Consent is limited to personal data necessary for the specified purpose."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "consent",
                  "s.6(1)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "severity": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-CON-006",
              "name": "ConsentRequestOfferedInOneLanguageOnly",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Consent request offered in one language only"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Option to access the consent request in English or an Eighth Schedule language."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use i18n resources for notice and consent text with at least one Indian language.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.6(3). Option to access the consent request in English or an Eighth Schedule language.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Use i18n resources for notice and consent text with at least one Indian language.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.6(3). Option to access the consent request in English or an Eighth Schedule language."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "consent",
                  "s.6(3)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.0",
                "severity": "low"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-001",
              "name": "PersonalDataWrittenToLogs",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data written to logs"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Secure personal data through encryption, obfuscation, masking or virtual tokens."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Mask or tokenise PII before logging (e.g. a***@x.com, ******1234).\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(a). Secure personal data through encryption, obfuscation, masking or virtual tokens.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Mask or tokenise PII before logging (e.g. a***@x.com, ******1234).\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(a). Secure personal data through encryption, obfuscation, masking or virtual tokens."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(a)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-002",
              "name": "PersonalDataStoredInPlaintext",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data stored in plaintext"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Encryption, obfuscation, masking or virtual tokens."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Encrypt sensitive columns at the field level, or store tokens instead of raw values.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(a). Encryption, obfuscation, masking or virtual tokens.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Encrypt sensitive columns at the field level, or store tokens instead of raw values.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(a). Encryption, obfuscation, masking or virtual tokens."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(a)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-003",
              "name": "WeakPasswordHashing",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Weak password hashing"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Reasonable security safeguards to prevent personal data breach."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use bcrypt, scrypt or argon2 with per-user salt.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(a). Reasonable security safeguards to prevent personal data breach.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Use bcrypt, scrypt or argon2 with per-user salt.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(a). Reasonable security safeguards to prevent personal data breach."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(a)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-004",
              "name": "HardcodedSecretsOrCredentials",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Hardcoded secrets or credentials"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Measures to control access to computer resources."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Move secrets to a secret manager or environment, rotate exposed keys, add .env to .gitignore.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(b). Measures to control access to computer resources.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Move secrets to a secret manager or environment, rotate exposed keys, add .env to .gitignore.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(b). Measures to control access to computer resources."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(b)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.5",
                "severity": "critical"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-005",
              "name": "PersonalDataExposedByAnUnauthenticatedRoute",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data exposed by an unauthenticated route"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Appropriate measures to control access."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Require authentication and check that the requester owns the record.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(b). Appropriate measures to control access.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Require authentication and check that the requester owns the record.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(b). Appropriate measures to control access."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(b)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.5",
                "severity": "critical"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-006",
              "name": "ExcessiveDataInApiResponses",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Excessive data in API responses"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Masking and minimising exposed personal data."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Return a response schema/serializer with only the needed fields; mask identifiers.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(a). Masking and minimising exposed personal data.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Return a response schema/serializer with only the needed fields; mask identifiers.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(a). Masking and minimising exposed personal data."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(a)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-007",
              "name": "NoAccessLoggingOnPersonalDataReads",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "No access logging on personal-data reads"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Visibility on access to personal data through logs, monitoring and review."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Write an audit event (who, what record, when) for every PII read and change.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(c). Visibility on access to personal data through logs, monitoring and review.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Write an audit event (who, what record, when) for every PII read and change.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(c). Visibility on access to personal data through logs, monitoring and review."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(c)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "severity": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-008",
              "name": "InsecureInfrastructureConfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Insecure infrastructure configuration"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Access control and appropriate technical and organisational measures."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Run as non-root, disable debug in production, restrict CORS, enforce TLS, block public buckets.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(b), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(g). Access control and appropriate technical and organisational measures.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Run as non-root, disable debug in production, restrict CORS, enforce TLS, block public buckets.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(b), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(g). Access control and appropriate technical and organisational measures."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(b)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(g)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-009",
              "name": "NoBackupConfiguredForPersonalDataStores",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "No backup configured for personal-data stores"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Reasonable measures for continued processing, such as data backups."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Configure automated, encrypted backups with tested restore.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(d). Reasonable measures for continued processing, such as data backups.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Configure automated, encrypted backups with tested restore.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(d). Reasonable measures for continued processing, such as data backups."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(d)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.0",
                "severity": "low"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-SEC-010",
              "name": "LogRetentionShorterThanOneYear",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Log retention shorter than one year"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Retain logs and personal data for one year for detecting and investigating unauthorised access."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Retain access/processing logs for at least 365 days in protected storage.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(e), DPDP Rules Rule 8(3). Retain logs and personal data for one year for detecting and investigating unauthorised access.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Retain access/processing logs for at least 365 days in protected storage.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(5), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(e), DPDP Rules Rule 8(3). Retain logs and personal data for one year for detecting and investigating unauthorised access."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "s.8(5)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(e)",
                  "Rule 8(3)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "severity": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-TP-001",
              "name": "PersonalDataSentToAThirdPartySdk",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data sent to a third-party SDK"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Fiduciary is responsible for processors, which must work under a valid contract with security terms."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Send pseudonymous IDs instead of PII, scrub events, and confirm a DPA exists with the vendor.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(1), DPDP Act s.8(2), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(f). Fiduciary is responsible for processors, which must work under a valid contract with security terms.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Send pseudonymous IDs instead of PII, scrub events, and confirm a DPA exists with the vendor.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(1), DPDP Act s.8(2), DPDP Rules Rule 6(1)(f). Fiduciary is responsible for processors, which must work under a valid contract with security terms."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "third parties",
                  "s.8(1)",
                  "s.8(2)",
                  "Rule 6(1)(f)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "severity": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-TP-002",
              "name": "PersonalDataStoredOrSentOutsideIndia",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data stored or sent outside India"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Transfers allowed unless the Government restricts a country or sets requirements by order."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Record transfer destinations and review them against current Government orders.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.16(1), DPDP Rules Rule 15. Transfers allowed unless the Government restricts a country or sets requirements by order.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Record transfer destinations and review them against current Government orders.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.16(1), DPDP Rules Rule 15. Transfers allowed unless the Government restricts a country or sets requirements by order."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "transfers",
                  "s.16(1)",
                  "Rule 15"
                ],
                "security-severity": "1.0",
                "severity": "info"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-BR-001",
              "name": "NoBreachNotificationMechanism",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "No breach notification mechanism"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Inform affected users without delay; send the Board a detailed report within 72 hours."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Add an incident module that can notify affected users and generate the Board report.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(6), DPDP Rules Rule 7(1), DPDP Rules Rule 7(2). Inform affected users without delay; send the Board a detailed report within 72 hours.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Add an incident module that can notify affected users and generate the Board report.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(6), DPDP Rules Rule 7(1), DPDP Rules Rule 7(2). Inform affected users without delay; send the Board a detailed report within 72 hours."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "breach",
                  "s.8(6)",
                  "Rule 7(1)",
                  "Rule 7(2)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "severity": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-RET-001",
              "name": "PersonalDataWithNoEraseOrAnonymisePath",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data with no erase or anonymise path"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Erase personal data on withdrawal or once the purpose is served, unless law requires retention."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Add erasure/anonymisation jobs and an erasure endpoint, respecting legal holds.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(7), DPDP Act s.12(3), DPDP Rules Rule 8. Erase personal data on withdrawal or once the purpose is served, unless law requires retention.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Add erasure/anonymisation jobs and an erasure endpoint, respecting legal holds.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(7), DPDP Act s.12(3), DPDP Rules Rule 8. Erase personal data on withdrawal or once the purpose is served, unless law requires retention."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "retention",
                  "s.8(7)",
                  "s.12(3)",
                  "Rule 8"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "severity": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-RET-002",
              "name": "ImmediateHardDeleteWithNoMinimumRetention",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Immediate hard delete with no minimum retention"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Retain personal data, traffic data and processing logs for at least one year, then erase."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Soft-delete and restrict access, keep processing logs for one year, then purge.\n\nLaw: DPDP Rules Rule 8(3). Retain personal data, traffic data and processing logs for at least one year, then erase.",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Soft-delete and restrict access, keep processing logs for one year, then purge.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Rules Rule 8(3). Retain personal data, traffic data and processing logs for at least one year, then erase."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "dpdp",
                  "privacy",
                  "security",
                  "retention",
                  "Rule 8(3)"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "severity": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPDP-RET-003",
              "name": "NoPreErasureNoticeToTheUser",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "No pre-erasure notice to the user"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Inform the user at least 48 hours before erasure (applies to Third Schedule classes)."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Send a notice 48 hours before scheduled erasure.\n\nLaw: DPDP Act s.8(8), DPDP Rules Rule 8(2). Inform the user at least 48 hours before erasure (applies to Third Schedule classes).",
                "markdown": "**Fix:** Send a notice 48 hours before scheduled erasure.\n\n**Law:** DPDP Act s.8(8), DPDP Rules Rule 8(2). Inform the user at least 48 hours before erasure (applies to Third Schedule classes)."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
